  "step_3": "The decision reason requires comparing the maximum and minimum outcomes and preferring the lottery with more favorable comparisons (i.e., more instances where one lottery has a higher outcome than the other). However, the individual in the verbal report does not mention such a comparison. Instead, the individual focuses on the emotional risk of losing 3000 Euros and the comfort of guaranteed 1500 Euros. There is no reference to evaluating favorable comparisons between maxima or minima. Therefore, the individual did not use the decision reason. The information considered (risk, certainty, emotional discomfort) differs from the required elements of the reason. The justification is based on risk perception and psychological safety, not on a formal count of favorable outcome comparisons. Hence, the decision reason was not used.",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
